          "text": "None rero, jewe umusavyi wawe, n’umpe umutima w’ubgenge, nshobore gucira abantu bawe imanza, mmenye gutandukanya ikibi n’iciza. None ni nde yoshobora gucira imanza iri hanga ryawe rihambaye?",
