              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Imana iramubarira, it’ Ivyo kw ari vyo usavye, ukaba udasavye kuramba, canke ng’ usabe ubutunzi, canke ng’ usabe kw abansi bawe bapfa; arik’ ukaba wisabiye ubgenge bgo guca imanza neza; ",
          "type": "text",
