            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Salomo aribambura, amenya kw ar’ inzozi. Maz’ aja i Yerusalemu, ahagarara imbere y’isandugu y’isezerano ry’Uhoraho, ahosereza ibimazi, ahatangira n’ibimazi vy’ishimwe, atumirira abantu biwe bose amazimano.",
          "type": "text",
